// swarm_coordinator: the leader has led long enough and every follower is within the gather radius: the lead goes
// to the host's pick, d4. The collector keeps its resource; the old leader follows the new one.
// method: organise_swarm
// expect: succeeded
//   1. !assign_role d4 leader s1
//   2. !assign_role d1 follower d4
//   3. !assign_role d3 collector r2

swarm s1
roster (d1 d3 d4)
leader d1
next_leader d4
lead_time_up
follower d4
distance_to_leader d4 2.5
collecting d3 r2
